	(text "VREGA : Internal regulated supply \noutput for analog domain (1.53V)\nVREGD : Internal regulated supply \noutput for digital domain (1.59V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.665 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "104b5988-f6a9-4592-bacb-da9e9646123c")
	)
	(text "The CSP package is sensitive to infrared light. When the silicon IC is subject to the photo-electric effect, an increase in leakage current is experienced.\nDue to the low power consumption of the IC this causes a change in signal and is common in the semiconductor industry with CSP devices.\n\nIf the IC could be exposed to IR in the product, then a dark glob-top epoxy material should cover the complete package to block infrared light. It is \nimportant to use sufficient material to completely cover the corners of the package. The glob-top also provides further advantages such as mechanical \nstrength and shock absorption."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.362 152.908 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "170ecfa3-8f34-45db-b94e-a42470a3e54f")
	)
